#, no-wrap
msgid "Consult [`synthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis\") for the synthesis methods themselves, and [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\") for a randomized alternative.\n"
msgstr "Consulta [`synthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis\") per i metodi di sintesi stessi, e [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\") per un'alternativa randomizzata.\n"
